{"type":"message","id":"79efec8b","parentId":"a3f16f4b","timestamp":"2026-03-26T05:22:52.453Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking what \"bad group chat session\" means and whether it's a bug. Let me explain clearly.","thinkingSignature":"0f67706d69b7ac9aacabf6e76144c28283ef2ef2f571183db5ce396e3aa20ca0"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 算是半个 bug，听我解释：\n\n**发生了什么：**\n1. 之前群里有条消息触发了我启动 embedded agent\n2. agent 启动时遇到 `deactivated_workspace` 错误，**没启动成功**\n3. 但 gateway 还是把这次失败创建成了一个 \"session\" 缓存了起来\n4. 这个 session 卡在半成品状态，之后群里所有消息都往这个坏 session 里塞，但永远没回应\n\n**根因：**\n`deactivated_workspace` 错误本身就是因为 embedded agent 初始化失败。可能跟旧模型（gpt-5.4/llde）配置问题有关。\n\n**为什么删掉就好了：**\n删掉坏的缓存，群里再来消息时，gateway 会创建一个**全新的干净 session**，用现在正常的 `MiniMax-M2.7` 模型，就能正常回复了。\n\n**算不算 bug：**\n严格说是个**边缘情况处理不当**——agent 初始化失败时，不应该留下一个损坏的 session 继续阻塞后续消息。是可以提 issue 的。\n\n先去群里测试一下，看现在能不能正常回复了？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":79,"output":250,"cacheRead":116452,"cacheWrite":1754,"totalTokens":118535,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774502558737}}
