\",\"logLevelId\":3,\"logLevelName\":\"INFO\",\"path\":{\"fullFilePath\":\"file:///root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.11_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.97_@types+express@5.0.6_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/dist/subsystem-DBBM_0ww.js:1058:14\",\"fileName\":\"subsystem-DBBM_0ww.js\",\"fileNameWithLine\":\"subsystem-DBBM_0ww.js:1058\",\"fileColumn\":\"14\",\"fileLine\":\"1058\",\"filePath\":\".local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.11_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.97_@types+express@5.0.6_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/dist/subsystem-DBBM_0ww.js\",\"filePathWithLine\":\".local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.11_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.97_@types+express@5.0.6_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/dist/subsystem-DBBM_0ww.js:1058\",\"method\":\"logToFile\"}},\"time\":\"2026-03-26T13:26:23.603+08:00\"}","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774502805394}}
{"type":"message","id":"ea33b104","parentId":"dc3d7153","timestamp":"2026-03-26T05:26:58.658Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Looking at the logs, I can see the key issue:\n\n```\nfeishu[default]: dispatch complete (queuedFinal=false, replies=0)\n```\n\nThis means the message was dispatched to the agent, but `replies=0` means the agent didn't produce any reply. The agent is receiving the message and processing it (dispatching to session), but not actually generating a response.\n\nThe key issue seems to be that:\n1. The session was dispatched to `agent:main:feishu:group:oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3`\n\n\n2. The dispatch completed but produced zero replies\n\nSo the problem isn't routing or workspace deactivation—it's that the agent isn't actually generating a response to the message. The logs confirm messages are being received and dispatched correctly, but the agent itself isn't replying, which suggests something is blocking the response generation. The `deactivated_workspace` error seems to have been resolved, but now the real problem is that the agent isn't replying at all. Looking at the session data, it appears the workspace may have been reactivated since the last error, so the current issue is that messages are coming through but getting `replies=0` - the agent is processing them without generating any response back to the group chat. This could indicate the embedded agent is running but failing silently, or there's a problem with how the main agent is configured to respond in group contexts.","thinkingSignature":"78035ed35fd00e9761975efb3bf3a10ee54d3785ca9d7d4f5bb2e587c2d48f74"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_477p0v3ex2xi_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"tail -100 /tmp/openclaw/openclaw-2026-03-26.log | grep -i \"embedded_run_agent\\|deactivated\\|dispatch\\|reply\\|error\" | tail -40"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":55102,"output":359,"cacheRead":21980,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":77441,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774502805404}}
