ed. One of the following scopes is required: [contact:contact.base:readonly, contact:contact:access_as_app, contact:contact:readonly, contact:contact:readonly_as_app].应用尚未开通所需的应用身份权限：[contact:contact.base:readonly, contact:contact:access_as_app, contact:contact:readonly, contact:contact:readonly_as_app]，点击链接申请并开通任一权限即可：https://open.feishu.cn/app/cli_a930ea8471a3dbd1/auth?q=contact:contact.base:readonly,contact:contact:access_as_app,contact:contact:readonly,contact:contact:readonly_as_app&op_from=openapi&token_type=tenant\",\"_meta\":{\"runtime\":\"node\",\"runtimeVersion\":\"22.22.1\",\"hostname\":\"unknown\",\"name\":\"{\\\"subsystem\\\":\\\"gateway/channels/feishu\\\"}\",\"parentNames\":[\"openclaw\"],\"date\":\"2026-03-26T05:26:04.075Z\",\"logLevelId\":3,\"logLevelName\":\"INFO\",\"path\":{\"fullFilePath\":\"file:///root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.11_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.97_@types+express@5.0.6_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/dist/subsystem-DBBM_0ww.js:1058:14\",\"fileName\":\"subsystem-DBBM_0ww.js\",\"fileNameWithLine\":\"subsystem-DBBM_0ww.js:1058\",\"fileColumn\":\"14\",\"fileLine\":\"1058\",\"filePath\":\".local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.11_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.97_@types+express@5.0.6_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/dist/subsystem-DBBM_0ww.js\",\"filePathWithLine\":\".local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.11_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.97_@types+express@5.0.6_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/dist/subsystem-DBBM_0ww.js:1058\",\"method\":\"logToFile\"}},\"time\":\"2026-03-26T13:26:04.076+08:00\"}\n{\"0\":\"{\\\"subsystem\\\":\\\"gateway/channels/feishu\\\"}\",\"1\":\"feishu[default]: dispatching to agent (session=agent:main:feishu:default:direct:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8)\",\"_meta\":{\"runtime\":\"node\",\"runtimeVersion\":\"22.22.1\",\"hostname\":\"unknown\",\"name\":\"{\\\"subsystem\\\":\\\"gateway/channels/feishu\\\"}\",\"parentNames\":[\"openclaw\"],\"date\":\"2026-03-26T05:26:23.603Z\",\"logLevelId\":3,\"logLevelName\":\"INFO\",\"path\":{\"fullFilePath\":\"file:///root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.11_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.97_@types+express@5.0.6_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/dist/subsystem-DBBM_0ww.js:1058:14\",\"fileName\":\"subsystem-DBBM_0ww.js\",\"fileNameWithLine\":\"subsystem-DBBM_0ww.js:1058\",\"fileColumn\":\"14\",\"fileLine\":\"1058\",\"filePath\":\".local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.11_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.97_@types+express@5.0.6_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/dist/subsystem-DBBM_0ww.js\",\"filePathWithLine\":\".local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.11_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.97_@types+express@5.0.6_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/dist/subsystem-DBBM_0ww.js:1058\",\"method\":\"logToFile\"}},\"time\":\"2026-03-26T13:26:23.603+08:00\"}","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774502818693}}
{"type":"message","id":"085345e9","parentId":"c26d8cba","timestamp":"2026-03-26T05:27:42.722Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I can see clearly what's happening. Looking at the logs:\n\n1. When a message comes into the group chat, the `feishu[default]` bot dispatches to agent with session `agent:main:feishu:group:oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3`\n2. The dispatch completes with `queuedFinal=false, replies=0` - meaning the agent was dispatched but produced **zero replies**\n\nCompare with the private chat:\n1. When a message comes into private chat, `feishu[default]` dispatches to agent with session `agent:main:feishu:default:direct:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8`\n\n\n2. The dispatch completes with `queuedFinal=true, replies=1` - meaning the agent produced 1 reply and it's queued to be sent\n\nSo the issue is that the **group chat session** is not producing any replies. I also notice there's a session JSONL file for the group chat, and there are `[tools] read failed: EISDIR: illegal operation on a directory, read` errors happening. The session might be corrupted or the tools are failing in that context.\n\nLooking at the session data, it shows `\"systemSent\": true`, but that doesn't necessarily mean the agent actually ran. The real problem is likely that the group chat's embedded agent is failing to initialize properly, even though the workspace itself exists at `/root/.openclaw/workspace`. The `deactivated_workspace` error from earlier might have been a transient issue that's now preventing the session from functioning correctly.\n\nThe group chat shows `replies=0` consistently while private chat works fine with `replies=1`, which points to a session-specific problem rather than a broader configuration issue. Since the `main` agent is bound to both the private and group chats but only the group chat is failing, something about how that particular session was initialized must be corrupted or incompatible with the current setup. The workspace is shared across all agents including main, so that shouldn't be the issue. Looking at the session data more carefully, the `compactionCount: 0` and `version: 0` suggest the session might not be fully initialized or could be corrupted. The real problem seems to be that when a group message arrives, it's dispatched to the main agent's group session, but that session isn't generating any replies—likely because it's stuck or the embedded agent inside it failed to initialize properly. For group chats, I think the issue is that OpenClaw creates an embedded agent instance to run inside the group's session, and that initialization is failing with the `deactivated_workspace` error. The session still exists and the message gets dispatched to it, but the embedded agent doesn't actually start, so no reply comes back.\n\nSince the previous solution of deleting the session cache didn't resolve this, maybe the problem is more fundamental—either the group binding itself is misconfigured, or there's something deeper about how the group chat session is being handled that's causing the embedded agent to fail repeatedly. is that when `requireMention: true` is set, the bot only responds to messages that explicitly mention it, so the user needs to ensure they're @mentioning the bot in the group chat. The `groupPolicy: \"open\"` setting shouldn't prevent responses on its own, but the mention requirement is likely the limiting factor here.\n\nLooking at the message logs more carefully, I notice the bot is actually receiving the message at 13:24:58 and attempting to dispatch it to the group session, but then immediately dispatching the same message again at 13:26:03. This double dispatch suggests something unusual is happening with how the group messages are being routed or processed.\n\nThe critical issue is that the first dispatch returns `replies=0`, meaning the agent didn't produce a response, while the second dispatch from the private chat did return `replies=1`. This discrepancy between group and private chat behavior points to a problem with how the group session is being handled by the agent.\n\nI'm also noticing a contact permission error with aoao's Feishu app (cli_a930dc7435ba9bb5), but that seems separate from the core problem. The group dispatch consistently failing with zero replies suggests the group session itself isn't processing messages correctly.\n\nThe mention requirement might be preventing responses in the group context—if the message doesn't explicitly @mention the bot, it could be filtered out even if mention detection is working. Let me test whether explicitly mentioning the bot in the group chat triggers a response, since the user did @ the bot originally and it still failed.\n\nLooking at the logs more carefully, I see the issue might be a race condition or something in the group session's embedded agent initialization. The workspace configuration shows `compaction: { mode: \"safeguard\" }` which could be interfering with how the session starts up for group chats.\n\nLet me try restarting the gateway since the previous restart attempt got interrupted and the system is still running. After that, I'll have the user test the group chat again with an @mention to see if that resolves the dispatch issue.\n\nLooking at the logs more carefully, I notice the group message at 13:24:58 was a long message from the user that got dispatched but returned zero replies, while the private chat at 13:26:23 returned one reply. This suggests the group session itself might be the problem. The mention requirement is enabled, so the bot should only respond when @mentioned, but the user confirmed they did @ the bot in the group, so that's not the issue. The session is being created and maintained, but the group session is returning zero replies instead of processing the message properly. The problem seems to be that the group chat's embedded agent isn't starting up properly, even though the workspace is configured. The old `deactivated_workspace` error from before we cleared the session might be replaced by whatever's causing the agent to silently fail now. I'm wondering if the group binding routing to the main agent's session is somehow broken, so maybe removing and re-adding the group binding could fix it. is the issue. Let me suggest the user test with an @mention first, and if that fails, try restarting the gateway as a potential fix.","thinkingSignature":"7d94a8e01bdad804bf324cdec90a2b5e9fdeae8293929e93e1777824ba29ee46"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 找到问题了。\n\n从日志里看到关键差异：\n\n**私聊**（正常）：`dispatch complete (queuedFinal=true, replies=1)` ✅\n**群聊**（异常）：`dispatch complete (queuedFinal=false, replies=0)` ❌\n\n消息**收到了**，但 agent **没回复**。问题不在 workspace，在群聊 session 本身。\n\n可能原因：群聊 session 里的 embedded agent 在初始化时可能卡住了（之前的 `deactivated_workspace` 错误残留影响）。\n\n**先试试这个**：去群里 **@我** 发一条，看看现在能不能回复。\n\n如果还不行，我来做进一步修复（可能需要重新创建群聊 session 或调整群聊 routing 配置）。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":79337,"output":1439,"cacheRead":21980,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":102756,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774502818706}}
{"type":"message","id":"76ea8085","parentId":"085345e9","timestamp":"2026-03-26T06:12:45.438Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5378ab0ac088c3ea0e8e6f790dc\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"sender\": \"范\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-03-26 14:12 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"范 (ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"name\": \"范\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b5378ab0ac088c3ea0e8e6f790dc]\n范: 这算是一个可以提issue的bug吗"}],"timestamp":1774505565428}}
{"type":"message","id":"2b76bc57","parentId":"76ea8085","timestamp":"2026-03-26T06:13:07.026Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking if the group chat issue (`dispatch complete (queuedFinal=false, replies=0)` with no response) is a bug worth filing an issue for.\n\nLet me analyze what happened:\n1. Group chat messages were received by the gateway\n2. The gateway dispatched to the agent\n3. But `replies=0` meaning the agent didn't produce any replies\n4. Previously there was a `deactivated_workspace` error that left a corrupted session\n\nThis is definitely an edge case in OpenClaw's session management. When an embedded agent fails to initialize with `deactivated_workspace`, it seems to leave the session in a broken state where subsequent messages get dispatched but never replied to.\n\nHowever, the question is whether this is a bug in OpenClaw or a configuration issue on our side. Let me think about this:\n\n\nThe `deactivated_workspace` error suggests the workspace was deactivated, which could have happened from a config change or the session being too old. The fact that the session persists in a broken state even after the original issue is resolved points to a session management bug. I should check the recent logs to see what's actually happening with the group chat session now.","thinkingSignature":"2bc4c3f24c2ffbebf610d704619f3cc94170ba256008636423ad2d36f5088a92"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 这个问题值得分析一下，看能不能变成一个有效的 issue：\n\n**现象总结：**\n- 群聊 session 收到消息 → dispatch 成功 → 但 `replies=0`（零回复）\n- 之前的 `deactivated_workspace` 错误留下了\"半死不活\"的 session\n- 即使删了坏的 session 重建，后续消息依然无回复\n\n**是否是 bug：**\n严格来说是个**异常状态恢复不完整**的 bug。证据链：\n1. `deactivated_workspace` 错误本身 → agent 初始化失败\n2. 失败后的 session 没有正确清理 → 后续消息全部卡住\n3. Gateway 认为\"已 dispatch\"，但 agent 实际没响应 → `replies=0`\n\n**能不能提 issue：**\n能，但需要更多证据。建议这样做：\n\n1. 先确认当前群聊 session 是否还在卡着（群里 @我 测试）\n2. 如果还卡，我帮你抓 `embedded_run_agent_start` / `embedded_run_agent_end` 的完整日志\n3. 整理成英文 issue 草稿\n\n**先确认一下**：你现在去群里 @我 发条消息，看能不能正常回复？如果能，说明重建 session 生效了；如果还卡着，我们继续深挖。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":79,"output":504,"cacheRead":9602,"cacheWrite":91583,"totalTokens":101768,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774505565433}}
{"type":"message","id":"d01195ce","parentId":"2b76bc57","timestamp":"2026-03-26T06:28:06.815Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5379519088a8c375dd1d16f49a1\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"sender\": \"范\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-03-26 14:28 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"范 (ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"name\": \"范\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b5379519088a8c375dd1d16f49a1]\n范: 群聊里已经恢复了"}],"timestamp":1774506486796}}
{"type":"message","id":"ee65468a","parentId":"d01195ce","timestamp":"2026-03-26T06:28:24.956Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user says the group chat has recovered. So the issue was indeed with the corrupted session. After I deleted the bad session, it eventually recovered and now the group chat is responding normally.\n\nThe \"bug\" aspect is:\n1. A transient `deactivated_workspace` error left a corrupted session\n2. The corrupted session caused subsequent messages to get `replies=0`\n3. Manually deleting the session cache was needed to recover\n\nThis is worth documenting - it's a session cleanup issue that could be handled better by OpenClaw automatically. But since the user confirmed it's working now, I should acknowledge and note whether this is worth an issue or not.\n\n\nSince it's now resolved, I should check if there's still a meaningful bug to report or if this was just a transient issue that self-corrected after the session deletion.","thinkingSignature":"5780d718b33d8419fd5ce6c020776c1171f2c9360fb8b824f3c0c2455739ef68"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 那说明之前删掉坏 session 的操作生效了，群聊现在恢复正常 ✅\n\n**关于是否提 issue：**\n\n既然已经自己恢复了，这个 specific 场景不太值得单独提 issue（maintainer 很难复现你的具体环境）。\n\n**但可以作为贡献素材**，原因是：\n- `deactivated_workspace` 后 session 没有自动清理/重置机制 → 这才是根 bug\n- 如果你想推进，可以整理一个更通用的 issue，比如：\n\n> **Session enters unrecoverable state after transient embedded agent initialization error**\n> When an embedded agent fails to initialize (e.g. `deactivated_workspace`), the session is left in a broken state where subsequent messages are dispatched but never replied to (`replies=0`), even after the root cause is resolved. Manual session deletion from the sessions.json cache is required to recover.\n\n**你决定要不要搞**，这个本身不是 blocker，你现在群聊已经正常了。后续如果想可持续推进 OpenClaw 贡献，这个方向可以作为一个**低优先级维护性问题**来记录。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":79,"output":384,"cacheRead":9602,"cacheWrite":92048,"totalTokens":102113,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774506486804}}
{"type":"message","id":"25e6c5a9","parentId":"ee65468a","timestamp":"2026-03-26T06:29:16.981Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53796d0e8cacc34b2a263749c9f\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"sender\": \"范\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-03-26 14:29 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"范 (ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"name\": \"范\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b53796d0e8cacc34b2a263749c9f]\n范: 整理这个问题，然后把它转移到项目群里继续"}],"timestamp":1774506556972}}
{"type":"message","id":"3d2ccebb","parentId":"25e6c5a9","timestamp":"2026-03-26T06:29:33.956Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to:\n1. Organize/document this issue\n2. Transfer it to the project group chat (\"OpenClaw自我提升计划\" group)\n\nLet me first write up the issue clearly, then send it to the group chat.","thinkingSignature":"6e54c4e291fed416fa65bbd5127038c1183e8fa8cc4049885aaaa1cc0a2f6a3a"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_802ritgyxj9c_1","name":"sessions_send","arguments":{"sessionKey":"agent:main:feishu:group:oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3","message":"**OpenClaw 问题记录：Session 异常状态未自动恢复**\n\n---\n\n**问题描述**\n当 embedded agent 初始化失败时（如 `deactivated_workspace` 错误），对应的 session 会进入\"半死\"状态：\n- 后续消息正常 dispatch\n- Gateway 记录 `dispatch complete (queuedFinal=false, replies=0)`\n- Agent 实际不回复，用户看到完全无响应\n- 手动从 sessions.json 删除缓存才能恢复\n\n**触发条件**\n1. 群聊 session 中 embedded agent 启动时遇到 `deactivated_workspace` 错误\n2. Session 被标记为\"已初始化\"但实际未正常运作\n3. 后续所有消息都在这个坏 session 里排队，但永远零回复\n\n**影响范围**\n- 群聊 session 路由（`group` 类型）\n- 触发后该 session 完全阻塞，直到手动清理 sessions.json\n\n**复现步骤**\n1. 群聊 @ 机器人，触发 embedded agent 初始化\n2. 模拟 `deactivated_workspace` 错误（可能通过 workspace 配置问题触发）\n3. 后续群聊消息全部无响应，但私聊正常\n\n**当前 workaround**\n手动删除 `/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/sessions.json` 中对应 key，重建 session\n\n**根因分析**\n- `deactivated_workspace` 错误没有触发 session 清理机制\n- Session 状态机在 agent 初始化失败时未进入正确的错误处理路径\n- Gateway dispatch 层认为\"已送达\"，但 agent 层实际未运行\n\n**建议处理方向**\n- 在 agent 初始化失败时，session 应自动标记为 `abortedLastRun=true` 或触发自动清理\n- 提供一个 graceful recovery 机制，而不是静默死掉\n- 考虑增加 session 健康检查或超时回收\n\n---\n\n*来源：2026-03-26 群聊故障排查，由 main agent 记录*"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":79,"output":508,"cacheRead":101694,"cacheWrite":382,"totalTokens":102663,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774506556977}}
