{"type":"message","id":"d8ea4960","parentId":"215b2520","timestamp":"2026-03-26T06:30:13.417Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The session send timed out. This might be related to the same issue - the group session is still having issues. Let me try a different approach - maybe the group chat still has issues with agent-to-agent communication.\n\nLet me try to check if the group session is working now by looking at the current status.\n\nActually, the issue might be that the session is still in a broken state. Let me check the sessions again.","thinkingSignature":"3a18a14ba8683ff9cbbc8987255608fdfee872912f0c80e07b50ebdfd1c7a733"},{"type":"text","text":"发送超时了，说明群聊 session 可能还有问题。让我先检查一下当前 session 状态：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_vyyfw0eofgkk_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat /root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/sessions.json | python3 -c \"\nimport json, sys\ndata = json.load(sys.stdin)\nfor k, v in data.items():\n    if 'oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3' in k:\n        print(f'Key: {k}')\n        print(f'SessionId: {v.get(\\\"sessionId\\\", \\\"N/A\\\")}')\n        print(f'UpdatedAt: {v.get(\\\"updatedAt\\\", \\\"N/A\\\")}')\n        print(f'AbortedLastRun: {v.get(\\\"abortedLastRun\\\", \\\"N/A\\\")}')\n        print('---')\n\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":80772,"output":278,"cacheRead":21980,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":103030,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774506604091}}
