{"type":"message","id":"194963ab","parentId":"b6fc7874","timestamp":"2026-03-26T06:30:30.548Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The session exists. But `abortedLastRun` is `false`. The session was updated at 1774506580902 (around 14:09 GMT+8 today).\n\nThe issue is that `sessions_send` to the group session is timing out. This might be because the embedded agent in that session is not responding (the same issue). Let me check if the current main agent (which is responding to this DM) can communicate with the group session.\n\nActually, I think the issue is that when I send to the group session, it's trying to use the broken embedded agent that's part of that group session. This is the same problem - the group session's embedded agent is not responding.\n\nLet me try a different approach. Instead of using `sessions_send`, I should just tell the user what happened and ask them to relay the content to the group, OR I can try to send directly to the Feishu group using the message tool.\n\nActually wait - I can use the `message` tool to send directly to the group chat! That's a different approach.","thinkingSignature":"6b2d44ec592d16fc6c89cff9a6cb8dc8a48a4db7c4b2b34b0f10c1fc5fcbfd1f"},{"type":"text","text":"群聊 session 还在，但 embedded agent 可能没响应。`sessions_send` 超时是因为它试图通过那个 session 路由，但 embedded agent 卡住了。\n\n我用 `message` 工具直接发到群：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_gvp05lwoc12h_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","channel":"feishu","target":"chat:oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3","accountId":"default","message":"**OpenClaw 问题记录：Session 异常状态未自动恢复**\n\n---\n\n**问题描述**\n当 embedded agent 初始化失败时（如 `deactivated_workspace` 错误），对应的 session 会进入\"半死\"状态：\n- 后续消息正常 dispatch\n- Gateway 记录 `dispatch complete (queuedFinal=false, replies=0)`\n- Agent 实际不回复，用户看到完全无响应\n- 手动从 sessions.json 删除缓存才能恢复\n\n**触发条件**\n1. 群聊 session 中 embedded agent 启动时遇到 `deactivated_workspace` 错误\n2. Session 被标记为\"已初始化\"但实际未正常运作\n3. 后续所有消息都在这个坏 session 里排队，但永远零回复\n\n**影响范围**\n- 群聊 session 路由（`group` 类型）\n- 触发后该 session 完全阻塞，直到手动清理 sessions.json\n\n**Workaround**\n手动删除 `/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/sessions.json` 中对应 key，重建 session\n\n**根因分析**\n- `deactivated_workspace` 错误没有触发 session 清理机制\n- Session 状态机在 agent 初始化失败时未进入正确的错误处理路径\n- Gateway dispatch 层认为\"已送达\"，但 agent 层实际未运行\n\n**建议处理方向**\n- 在 agent 初始化失败时，session 应自动标记为 `abortedLastRun=true` 或触发自动清理\n- 提供 graceful recovery 机制，而不是静默死掉\n- 考虑增加 session 健康检查或超时回收\n\n---\n\n*来源：2026-03-26 群聊故障排查，由 main agent 记录*"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":81140,"output":686,"cacheRead":21980,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":103806,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774506613498}}
