{"type":"message","id":"96edb5ec","parentId":"b6cfb9d5","timestamp":"2026-03-26T10:18:25.674Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Thu 2026-03-26 18:17 GMT+8] 状态：成功\n\n任务：修复 OpenClaw PR #55008 和 #55013 的 review 反馈问题\n\n结果：\n\n■ PR #55008 — 恢复被删除的 feishu skills 声明\n  分支：`docs/clarify-message-channel-plugin-extensibility`\n  修复：在 `extensions/feishu/openclaw.plugin.json` 恢复了被误删的 `\"skills\": [\"./skills\"]`\n  Commit：`bac6026fd3` — fix(openclaw): restore skills declaration accidentally removed in #55008\n\n■ PR #55013 — 修正 groupPolicy 描述\n  分支：`docs/clarify-feishu-routing-fallback`\n  修复：4 个文档文件中，将 groupPolicy 从\"决定由哪个 agent 处理\"修正为\"访问控制检查（open/allowlist/disabled），决定群组消息是否被允许，而非决定 agent\"\n  - `docs/channels/feishu.md` — 路由段落重写，明确 groupPolicy 是 access-control check\n  - `docs/zh-CN/channels/feishu.md` — 中文版同步修正\n  - `docs/gateway/configuration-reference.md` — 移除\"to select the handling agent\"，补全 access-control 说明\n  - `docs/zh-CN/gateway/configuration-reference.md` — 中文版同步补全\n  Commit：`feeea5f817` — fix(docs): correct groupPolicy description — access control, not agent selection\n\n原因：均已提交到对应分支，无阻塞。"}],"timestamp":1774520305666,"provenance":{"kind":"inter_session","sourceSessionKey":"agent:ling:feishu:ling:direct:ou_1bdff494bc4d097bdd831af987852713","sourceChannel":"webchat","sourceTool":"sessions_send"}}}
